  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Saros_Fruit_Trees/BH_FT_Header.webp\" alt=\"Header\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Saros_Fruit_Trees/BH_FT_Overview.webp\" alt=\"overview\"> <strong>本模組新增擁有獨特加工系統的水果樹</strong></p>\n<p>如有建議或錯誤回報，請透過我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/H8a8CJe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 進行回報。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Saros_Fruit_Trees/BH_FT_Content.webp\" alt=\"Features\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>水果樹</strong> 🍎🍊</p>\n<ul>\n<li>蘋果樹、柳橙樹、梨樹，甚至還有金蘋果樹（不會過於強大）。</li></ul></li>\n<li><p><strong>獨特的生長階段</strong> 🌱</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每棵樹都有不同的生長階段，從幼苗到完全成熟。</li></ul></li>\n<li><p><strong>自訂內容</strong> 🎨</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自訂音效、模型與材質，包含動態材質與 3D 動畫。</li></ul></li>\n<li><p><strong>蠕蟲與蘋果</strong> 🪱</p>\n<ul>\n<li>沒錯，還有蠕蟲工廠！也包含了蠕蟲以及長有蠕蟲的蘋果。</li></ul></li>\n<li><p><strong>多人遊戲與生存模式相容</strong> 🌐</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完美整合至多人遊戲與生存模式的玩法中。</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Saros_Fruit_Trees/BH_FT_SupportedVersions.webp\" alt=\"support\"></p>\n<h3>目前支援的版本 ✅</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>26.1</strong> Forge/NeoForge/Fabric</li>\n<li><strong>1.21.10</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.21.9</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.21.8</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.21.7</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.21.6</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.21.5</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.21.3</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.21.1</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.21</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.20.6</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.20.4</strong> Forge</li>\n<li><strong>1.20.1</strong> (Forge/Fabric/Quilt)</li>\n<li><strong>1.19.4</strong> Forge</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Saros_Fruit_Trees/BH_FT_Tutorial.webp\" alt=\"tut\"></p>\n<h2>僅提供德文版本（已過時）</h2>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UlS-q3R-ZIY?si=mZkjpGlQAnBnRm7u\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>如需更多更新資訊與錯誤回報，歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/H8a8CJe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>專案支援與使用規範</strong></p>\n<p><strong>伺服器架設：</strong>為了獲得最佳效能，建議使用橫幅中連結的 BisectHosting。</p>\n<p><strong>模組包：</strong>您可以自由將本作品納入任何模組包中。請務必透過提供此專案頁面的連結來給予適當的署名。</p>",
